Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:18:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 32/32] metal: skip exact-zero visibilities (ducc0 nvis mask),
 float vForce screens

Count only nonzero ms for kernel selection (ducc0's nvis excludes
flagged/zero-weight); skip zero items in gather (exact: zero adds zero).
LWA: 37% fewer taps, 134/266 planes go empty-skipped, occupancy cols
41%->10%. 4096: 70.8s->37.6s. Float trig + vvsincosf screens; screen
timer split.

